  << /ActualText (IBM \024 AI UX Innovation Designer \055 Nov 2021 \023 July 2026\n\n Led design of Agentic AI solutions across enterprise environments\054 aligning UX with AML\054 KYC\054 and compliance frameworks\n Delivered AI workflows\054 service models\054 and scalable architectures improving operational efficiency and reducing risk\056\n\nSenior UX Product Designer 2021 \055 Vodafone \057 Accenture \n\n Owned end\055to\055end product lifecycle\054 from research to delivery\056\n Designed cross\055platform experiences \050web\054 mobile\054 Android\057iOS\051\n\nSenior UX Product Designer Roles  2013 \023 2021 \174 Ocado \267 Technip \267 Capgemini \267 HSBC \267 ASOS \267 Kantar\n\n Delivered enterprise UX \046 product strategy across fintech\054 e\055commerce\054 and data platforms\n Led user research\054 journey mapping\054 and service design\n Designed cross\055platform experiences \050web\054 mobile\054 Android\057iOS\051\n Collaborated with global engineering teams on large\055scale digital transformation\056\n\nAI \046 Product Design Skills\072\n\050Agentic AI \267 UX\057UI Strategy \267 Service Design Thinking \267 AI Workflows\267 Data Strategies  \267 SaaS \267 requirements \267 User Problem Framing \267 User Stories \267 User Journeys \267 Persona \267 hypotheses \267 Figma \267 Prototyping \267 IA \267 Wireframing \267 Accessibility \267 Stakeholder Management \267 Brand Guidelines \nAI \046 Creative Tools\050ChatGPT \267 Claude \267 Midjourney \267 Runway \267 Gemini \267 Copilot\nTechnical\050HTML \267 CSS \267 JavaScript \050basic\051 \267 SaaS \267 Cloud Systems\nHuman Skills\050Leadership \267 Stakeholder Management \267 Communication \267 Critical Thinking \267 Client Facing \267 Workshop Facilitation \nProduct Management \nCertified Scrum Agile Master  \267 Monday \267 Workflow \267 Roadmaps)
